/ How far the receipts have come (ReceiptCountsQuery): every receipt, whatever its date or currency.
- rows = dashboard_receipt_rows(counts)
section.chart-card aria-labelledby="chart-receipts-title"
  .chart-card-header
    div
      h2#chart-receipts-title.text-lg Receipts
      p.text-sm.text-ink-muted Every stored receipt: read by OCR, reviewed into the ledger, failed, with ground truth.
    = ui_link_button "All receipts", receipts_path, variant: :ghost, size: :sm, data: { turbo_prefetch: false }
  - if counts.total.zero?
    = render "ui/callout" do
      p.text-sm
        | No receipts yet.
        =< link_to "Upload the first one", new_receipt_path
  - else
    = bar_chart dashboard_receipt_series(rows), id: "chart-receipts", height: "sm", discrete: true, legend: false
    details.chart-figures
      summary Figures as a table
      .data-grid-wrapper
        table.data-grid
          caption.sr-only Receipts by stage
          thead
            tr
              th scope="col" Stage
              th.data-grid-num scope="col" Receipts
          tbody
            - rows.each do |label, count|
              tr
                th scope="row" = label
                td.data-grid-num = number_with_delimiter(count, delimiter: " ")
